# Written by the NEREUS setup screen.
#
# Boundary and region lines are applied in order and the LAST match wins, which
# is what resolves the corners. Put a moving lid last to have it beat the side
# walls; put no-slip walls last to have them beat an inlet.

sampling center

boundary xmin noslip
boundary xmax noslip
boundary ymin noslip
boundary ymax moving u="1.0" v="0" w="0"
boundary zmin noslip
boundary zmax noslip
